# Agentic Workflow - Selective Git Tracking
# Only preserved artifacts are tracked, all else is ignored

# Ignore everything by default
*

# Except the artifacts directory structure
!artifacts/
!artifacts/*/
!artifacts/*/02-design/
!artifacts/*/10-documentation/

# Only track preserved artifacts (after housekeeping)
!artifacts/*/02-design/architecture-diagram.md
!artifacts/*/10-documentation/api-docs.md

# Keep this .gitignore
!.gitignore
